      "content": "rebuild? how? i don't have anything to rebuild with. the people i used to know won't even look me in the eye. the industry is a joke now. there's no \"new version\" of me, there's just the mess that's left behind. it feels like the end of the road, honestly. like i've reached the part where the story just stops.",
